/*
 * Implements semantic validation for class-based list comprehensions.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - validating class iterator methods(BEGIN / END / NEXT),
 *   - enforcing copy-mode for class list comprehensions,
 *   - rejecting tuple-mode comprehensions on class objects,
 *   - constructing LoopValue structures using class iterator semantics,
 *   - appending values dynamically using SliceAppendValue,
 *   - producing ListComprValue results wrapped in CopierValue.
 *
 * Class list comprehensions iterate over user-defined class iterators and
 * accumulate results into a dynamically growing slice.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::compose::slicefor::class_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/compose/slicefor/class_.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-05-18
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
